                        


Item #: SCP-5083 

Object Class: Safe 

Special Containment Procedures: 

SCP-5083 is to be kept in a wooden box measuring 5.5 inches in width and 3.5 inches in length. Due to SCP-5083 being used for personal gain becoming a possibility, SCP-5083's box is to be under 24/7 surveillance. Any individual attempting to interact in any way with SCP-5083 without authorization from the 05-Council is to be immediately terminated.

Description: 

SCP-5083 is a standard black universal tv remote measuring 2 inches in width and 7.5 inches in length. Despite SCP-5083 being a tv remote, it has no observable space to insert batteries. Each button on SCP-5038 seemingly has a different effect on reality but can be made to affect one specific item or individual by pointing SCP-5083 at the target and pressing a button.

